      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW MANTRA (2) was big odds last time but gave a huge sight after a fast early split, grabbed late but holding on to a placing when a 0.8 lengths third (16.80) over 300m at this track. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Makes plenty of appeal. TRANSFORMATION (7) produced a moderate effort last time when sixth at Angle Park over 342m behind Victa Spencer (20.35) in a Grade 5. Was in the money prior to that. Should be about the mark. SPLIT VISION (1) finished well back at Angle Park last time when a 6 length fifth (20.16) but back to the course now of his latest success. The form out of last run is most impressive. Should be in this for a long way. HAYDEN'S MILK (4) found the frame for the second consecutive time when narrowly beaten into second last time out (16.91) over 300m at this track.",
